OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy skies
OL,6,Ffeeding up the Central Belt, perhaps
OL,7,Fbringing drizzly showers by dawn.
OL,8,FElsewhere dry with clear spells
OL,9,Fbringing the risk of rural frost and
OL,10,Ffog patches come dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FCentral Belt mainly cloudy
OL,13,Fwith the odd light drizzly shower.
OL,14,FElsewhere dry with bright and sunny
OL,15,Fspells best across Argyll and
OL,16,FAyrshire. Winds light mainly from the
OL,17,Feast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
