OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FCentral Belt mainly cloudy with a few
OL,7,Flight showers, Elsewhere dry with
OL,8,Fbrighter spells. Winds light. Early
OL,9,Ffrost and a few fog patches in west.
